<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<div style="font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #333333; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 600px; border: 1px solid #3a5c5e; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background-color: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">
<div style="padding: 30px 20px 35px 20px; background-color: #4b777a; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4b777a 0%, #3a5c5e 100%); text-align: center;">
<div style="margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: right;"><a href="https://k2insurance.oopy.io" style="color: #cce2e3; text-decoration: none; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: bold; background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(204,226,227,0.4); display: inline-block;">⭐ About Us &amp; Reviews </a></div>

<div style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: 900; color: #ffffff; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 6px; text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);">K2 <span style="font-size: 16px; color: #cce2e3; letter-spacing: 4px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: middle; margin-left: 2px;">INSURANCE</span></div>

<div style="font-size: 13px; color: #e2f1f2; font-style: italic; letter-spacing: 0.8px; opacity: 0.95;">Your Partner in Health and Security</div>
</div>

<div style="padding: 32px 30px; background-color: #ffffff;">
<p style="margin-top: 0;">안녕하세요, <strong>{{{Agent_Payout__c.Agent__c}}}</strong> 님.</p>
<p style="color: #6b8789; margin-top: 0;">Hello, {{{Agent_Payout__c.Agent__c}}}.</p>

<p>커미션 지급 내역을 안내드립니다.<br />상세 내역은 첨부된 <strong>Agent Payout Statement PDF</strong>를 확인해 주세요.</p>
<p style="color: #6b8789;">Please find your commission payout summary below. The attached Agent Payout Statement PDF contains the detailed breakdown.</p>

<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border: 1px solid #d8e4e5; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 24px 0; font-size: 14px;" width="100%">

<tr><th scope="row" align="left" style="padding: 12px; background-color: #f1f6f6; border-bottom: 1px solid #d8e4e5; font-weight: normal; width: 44%;">지급 번호 / Payout #</th><td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #d8e4e5;">{{{Agent_Payout__c.Name}}}</td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row" align="left" style="padding: 12px; background-color: #f1f6f6; border-bottom: 1px solid #d8e4e5; font-weight: normal;">지급 대상 기간 / Period</th><td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #d8e4e5;">{{{Agent_Payout__c.Period_Label__c}}}</td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row" align="left" style="padding: 12px; background-color: #f1f6f6; border-bottom: 1px solid #d8e4e5; font-weight: normal;">실지급액 / Amount Paid</th><td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #d8e4e5; font-weight: bold; color: #3a6366;">{{{Agent_Payout__c.Amount_Paid__c}}}</td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row" align="left" style="padding: 12px; background-color: #f1f6f6; font-weight: normal;">지급일 / Paid Date</th><td style="padding: 12px;">{{{Agent_Payout__c.Paid_Date__c}}}</td></tr>

</table>

<p>내역 확인 후 문의 사항이나 확인이 필요한 항목이 있으시면 이 이메일로 회신해 주세요.</p>
<p style="color: #6b8789;">If you have any questions or notice any discrepancies, please reply to this email.</p>
<p style="margin-top: 28px;">감사합니다.<br /><span style="color: #6b8789;">Thank you,</span></p>
<p style="font-weight: bold; color: #3a6366;">K2 Insurance 팀 드림<br /><span style="font-weight: normal; color: #6b8789;">K2 Insurance Team</span></p>
</div>

<div style="background-color: #fafbfc; border-top: 1px solid #f0f4f6; padding: 25px 0 0 0; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #555555; line-height: 1.7;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-bottom: 15px;" width="100%">

