			<td align="center" style="font-size: 13.5px; padding: 2px 0;">Email: <a href="mailto:info@kay2ins.com" style="color: #3a6366; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;">info@kay2ins.com</a></td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td align="center" style="font-size: 13.5px; padding: 2px 0;">Web: <a href="https://k2insurance.oopy.io" style="color: #3a6366; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;">k2insurance.oopy.io</a></td>
		</tr>

</table>

<p style="margin: 0 0 20px 0; color: #666666;">Address: 870 Hebron Pkwy #601, Lewisville, TX 75057</p>

<div style="background-color: #4b777a; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4b777a 0%, #3a5c5e 100%); padding: 18px 20px; margin-top: 5px;"><span style="font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; display: block;">Life • Annuity • Health • Medicare • Group Health</span> <span style="font-style: italic; display: block; text-align: center; color: #cce2e3; font-size: 10.5px; margin-top: 6px; opacity: 0.9;">K2 Insurance is a registered licensed agency. All communications are strictly confidential.</span></div>
